{"asset_key":"ep4/quest_story_14215340","episode":"ep4","category":"quest_story","story_id":"14215340","schema_version":1,"lang":"kr","texts":{"say:1:1421534001:1":{"text":"저희 작품을 제출하러 왔어요!","source_cn":"我们来提交作品了！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x65F414CA904F8A44","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:2:1421534002:1":{"text":"이제 너희만 남았어! 어디 반의 작품을 볼까... 칼끝이 아주 날카롭네! 칼자루는 고풍스럽고 아름답게 조각했고... 대단한 기술이야. 이제 핵심은 완벽한 무게인데...","source_cn":"就差你们了！我来看看瓦恩的作品——剑锋飒沓锐利！剑柄雕...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x7B6FE962C89E370C","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:3:1421534003:1":{"text":"반, 자신과의 싸움에서 이긴 것 같군.","source_cn":"瓦恩，看来你真的突破了你自己。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x3FD75D135B2F62F4","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1421534004:1":{"text":"토너먼트를 통과한 장인은 너와 테고다, 오직 둘뿐이야.","source_cn":"我宣布，你和铁哥达是唯二通过淘汰赛考验的工匠。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xDA2730E4E3A6B946","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1421534005:1":{"text":"테고다?","source_cn":"铁哥达？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xDF93F357CF2D491E","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:6:1421534006:1":{"text":"아이언비어드의 제자야... 테고다도 이번 제련 대회에 참가했었구나.","source_cn":"是铁须的徒弟……原来他也参加这次的锻魂大赛了。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x276174D652842280","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:7:1421534007:1":{"text":"이번 제련 대회의 우승자는 마지막 대결을 통해 테고다와 반 중에 결정됩니다!","source_cn":"铁哥达和瓦恩，本届锻魂大赛的冠军将通过接下来的最终比试...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x0CB39322563141AF","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:10:1421534008:1":{"text":"반?! 마지막 대결 상대가 너일 줄 몰랐어.","source_cn":"瓦恩？！真没想到最后的对手是你。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x71867B2D459D2516","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:11:1421534009:1":{"text":"테고다... 그리고 네 옆엔...","source_cn":"铁哥达……还有你身边这是……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xBFD62CE19D06A473","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:12:1421534010:1":{"text":"이번에 알게 된 용병 친구 슬래그야. 나를 도와주기 위해 한참 배를 타고 깊은바위 마을에 왔어...","source_cn":"这是我在外认识的佣兵朋友斯拉格，他为了帮我试剑特意坐很...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x811820F14A3902E6","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:13:1421534011:1":{"text":"이번 대회에서 스승님의 조언이 큰 도움이 됐어...","source_cn":"这次比赛里，师父的建议帮了我很多……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x689E6ABDEF8BAC1C","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:14:1421534012:1":{"text":"하지만 결국 슬래그에게 맞는 좋은 무기를 만들겠다는 결심 덕분에 시험에 통과할 수 있었어!","source_cn":"但最终是为斯拉格锻造一把趁手的好武器的决心让我通过了考验！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x43A5D492F644940C","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:15:1421534013:1":{"text":"검, 테고다, 좋아!","source_cn":"剑，铁哥达，好！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x2B928DBF498128C8","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:17:1421534014:1":{"text":"마지막 대결... 어디 해보자. 난 네가 두렵지 않아!","source_cn":"最终比试……尽管来吧，我可不会怕你！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x52F25A0E0AF5793F","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:19:1421534015:1":{"text":"마지막 대결은 제작한 무기를 실전에서 테스트하는 겁니다. 두 명의 스태프가 여러분이 만든 무기로 전투를 치르게 됩니다. 그리고 전투에서 승리한 사람의 손에 있는 무기를 만든 장인이 이번 대회의 우승자입니다!","source_cn":"最终比试是对你们锻造的武器进行实战测试，将会有两名工作...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xDB264CEC939FD7F2","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:21:1421534016:1":{"text":"치피는 대회에 참가하고 싶어요! 반이 만든 검으로 싸우고 싶어요!","source_cn":"满满想要报名参赛！我想用瓦恩锻造的剑战斗！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xA699168F13322AE6","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:23:1421534017:1":{"text":"햄스터, 나, 받아들인다.","source_cn":"仓鼠，我，迎战。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x1C086B0999CBB053","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:24:1421534018:1":{"text":"직접 하겠다고요?... 좋아요. 정말 치열한 결전이 되겠군요!","source_cn":"你们想亲自来吗……好吧。真是一场激昂澎湃的决战！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x9BACCB1FAE030DCF","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:26:1421534019:1":{"text":"명심하세요, 여러분의 전투 기술을 겨루는 게 아니라 무기를 겨루는 겁니다.","source_cn":"记住，比拼的不是你们的战斗技巧，而是你们手中的武器。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xE2910C00786C719B","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:27:1421534020:1":{"text":"지금부터 결승 경기가 시작됩니다!","source_cn":"现在我宣布，最终比试正式开始！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xA89372B31B69D3DF","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""}},"speakers":{"speaker:漫漫":{"text":"해미","source":"漫漫","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"},"speaker:锻魂大赛主持人":{"text":"제련 대회 진행자","source":"锻魂大赛主持人","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"},"speaker:瓦恩":{"text":"반","source":"瓦恩","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"},"speaker:学徒铁哥达":{"text":"견습생 테고다","source":"学徒铁哥达","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"},"speaker:佣兵斯拉格":{"text":"용병 슬래그","source":"佣兵斯拉格","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"},"speaker:满满":{"text":"치피","source":"满满","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"}},"stats":{"flow_row_count":21,"localized_text_count":20,"speaker_count":6}}